@namespace SpaceSails.Client.Pages
@implements IHandleEvent
@using System.Globalization
@*
    #251 · ONE OCCUPATION OF ONE TABLE — the seated region and the two things it raises, on one file.

    Thirty-eight consecutive lines of Map.razor. The seated region is TWO FRAMES of the same fact: docked,
    the table is a strip along the bottom with the case work on it; adrift, it is a card. One `@if` binds
    the table and a second chooses the frame, which is why the whole nested block had to travel together —
    splitting it would have left half a sentence on either side. Behind it, the two things a seated captain
    can put up: the paper, and the confirm that says standing up costs you the rest.

    Moved by PURE MOTION: every page member the block reads is a [Parameter] with the SAME NAME, so not one
    character between the fences changed — including the page's own closing note, "…and the seated region
    closes. Two frames, one occupation of one table", which is about this block and travels with it.

    IHandleEvent repeats the page's own override (Map.Sim.cs). The .razor.css beside this file carries no
    rules; it exists to give the component Map.razor.css's scope (pinned in SpaceSails.Client.csproj), and
    the four surfaces keep their own sheets.
*@
@* ── MARKUP BEGINS · verbatim from Map.razor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
    @if (SeatedTable is { } tab)
    {
    @if (SeatedIsDocked)
    {
        <SeatedDockedStrip _satchel="@_satchel" _seatedNewsOpen="@_seatedNewsOpen"
                           ACabinetLeafToWork="@ACabinetLeafToWork" CabinetLeafHint="@CabinetLeafHint"
                           CabinetLeafLabel="@CabinetLeafLabel" CanSpreadTheCaseHere="@CanSpreadTheCaseHere"
                           OpenTheSpread="@OpenTheSpread" ProcessingFraction="@ProcessingFraction"
                           ProcessingUnderway="@ProcessingUnderway" SatchelLabel="@SatchelLabel"
                           SeatedCompanyLine="@SeatedCompanyLine" SeatedCustomerLine="@SeatedCustomerLine"
                           SeatedOverheardLine="@SeatedOverheardLine" SpreadDoorHint="@SpreadDoorHint"
                           SpreadDoorLabel="@SpreadDoorLabel" TableMoveClicked="@TableMoveClicked"
                           TableMoveIsUrged="@TableMoveIsUrged" TableMoveOnOffer="@TableMoveOnOffer"
                           TableMoveRefusal="@TableMoveRefusal" TableMovesOnTheTable="@TableMovesOnTheTable"
                           TableShow="@TableShow" TableShowables="@TableShowables"
                           ToggleSeatedNews="@ToggleSeatedNews" WorkTheCabinetLeaf="@WorkTheCabinetLeaf" tab="@tab" />
    }
    else
    {
        <TableCard _credits="@_credits" _satchel="@_satchel" CloseTable="@CloseTable" Dismiss="@Dismiss"
                   SatchelLabel="@SatchelLabel" TableMoveClicked="@TableMoveClicked"
                   TableMoveIsUrged="@TableMoveIsUrged" TableMoveOnOffer="@TableMoveOnOffer"
                   TableMoveRefusal="@TableMoveRefusal" TableMovesOnTheTable="@TableMovesOnTheTable"
                   TableShow="@TableShow" TableShowables="@TableShowables" tab="@tab" />
    }
    }   @* …and the seated region closes. Two frames, one occupation of one table. *@

    @if (ThePaperIsOpen)
    {
        <ThePaperCard AlreadyClipped="@AlreadyClipped" ClipThisStory="@ClipThisStory"
                      CloseSeatedNews="@CloseSeatedNews" Dismiss="@Dismiss" SeatedNewsFeed="@SeatedNewsFeed"
                      SeatedNewsItemCount="@SeatedNewsItemCount" SimTime="@SimTime" />
    }

    @if (TheStandUpConfirmIsUp)
    {
        <StandUpConfirmCard Dismiss="@Dismiss" KeepYourSeat="@KeepYourSeat"
                            StandingUpCostsARest="@StandingUpCostsARest" StandUpFromTable="@StandUpFromTable" />
    }
@* ── MARKUP ENDS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── *@
